WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:07.217
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: Stay Safe and Honest with AI.

2
00:00:07.517 --> 00:00:13.548
Protect your privacy and use AI honestly. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:21.022
Step one. Never type passwords, ID numbers or bank details into an AI chat.

4
00:00:22.017 --> 00:00:28.248
Step two. Hide private details. Use a placeholder like name in brackets instead of real names.

5
00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:34.610
Step three. Do not copy blindly. Read, think and rewrite in your own words.

6
00:00:35.617 --> 00:00:46.517
Step four. Be honest. If you used AI for school or work, say how you used it. AI is a helper, not a replacement for your thinking.

7
00:00:47.517 --> 00:00:51.527
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:51.827 --> 00:00:54.663
List 3 things you must never type into AI.

9
00:00:54.963 --> 00:00:57.705
Rewrite an AI answer in your own words.

10
00:00:58.005 --> 00:01:01.224
Write one honest sentence about how you used AI.

11
00:01:01.524 --> 00:01:02.548
Well done!

